From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:51:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build: accept xdg-desktop-portal 1.18.4

Alpine 3.21 ships xdg-desktop-portal 1.18.4. The backend generates its
D-Bus code from the interface XML that Gnoblin bundles, so it builds
against the 1.18.4 package.

The 1.18.4 frontend has no USB portal. Sandboxed applications cannot
ask for USB devices, and the frontend never calls the USB dialog of
this backend. Other portal features that the frontend added in 1.19
and 1.20 are also absent.

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index da92925..6992bd0 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 gnome = import('gnome')
 pkg = import('pkgconfig')
 
-xdg_desktop_portal_dep = dependency('xdg-desktop-portal', version: '>= 1.20.0')
+xdg_desktop_portal_dep = dependency('xdg-desktop-portal', version: '>= 1.18.4')
 
 # Desktop Portal D-Bus interfaces
 desktop_portal_dbus_interfaces = gnome_portal_interfaces + [
